        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About This Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >REVERSI xVSx is a Reversi game with modern features, including custom 3D graphics, user-created AI, online multiplayer, and streamer-viewer match functionality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✅ <strong>Try Almost Everything in the Demo!</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full-featured online battles between demo versions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All custom assets (stones, board, background, BGM, CPU) can be used in the full version</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎨 <strong>Fully Customizable!</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create or download your own stones, boards, backgrounds, music, and CPU opponents</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In-game guide explains how to make your own assets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Load from local files with ease</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🤖 <strong>Build Your Own CPU Opponents!</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can play against a custom CPU with an AI you've created.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can also set rewards for playing against it.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎲 <strong>Variety of Game Modes</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classic Reversi rules</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Single-color mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique rules like &quot;lose on misclick&quot;</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌐 <strong>Online Multiplayer &amp; Viewer Interaction</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Majority Vote Reversi&quot; for up to 10 players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Streamer mode: viewers vote in chat to decide moves</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >📺 <strong>Streaming &amp; Video Use</strong><br>You are free to livestream or upload gameplay videos of this game and its demo—<br>whether you're an individual or a company, for free or for profit.<br>No permission or report is required (we probably can't respond anyway).<br>We will not charge or contact you afterward.<br>(<i>However, please refrain from using the game in ways that violate public decency.</i>)</p>",
